Split the null and bounds checks into separate cold branches with `__builtin_expect`, keeping the common valid lookup as straight-line fall-through to reduce taken-branch pressure in the hot decode path.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    const Profile* p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    if (__builtin_expect(profileIndex >= p->numFields, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return p->fields[profileIndex].num;
}
```